# 3. AWS Account Strategy

Large organizations avoid putting everything in one AWS account.

Recommended structure:

```text
AWS Organization

        |

--------------------------------

Management Account

        |

Security Account

        |

Logging Account

        |

Development Account

        |

Testing Account

        |

Production Account

--------------------------------
```

---

