# 5. Production EKS Cluster Design

Recommended:

* Private worker nodes
* Multiple Availability Zones
* Managed Node Groups
* Auto Scaling
* Encryption enabled
* Logging enabled

Architecture:

```text
                 AWS Region


        AZ-A              AZ-B              AZ-C


     Private          Private           Private
     Subnet           Subnet            Subnet


     Node             Node              Node


      Pods             Pods              Pods
```

---

# 6. High Availability Design

High availability means:

"The system continues working even when something fails."

---

## Multiple Availability Zones

Bad:

```text
Single AZ

Node failure

Application Down
```

---

Good:

```text
AZ-A

Node


AZ-B

Node


AZ-C

Node
```

