# 20. Right-Sizing Resources

Bad:

```yaml
resources:

 requests:

   cpu: 8

   memory: 32Gi
```

Application uses:

```text
CPU: 1

Memory: 2Gi
```

Waste:

```text
Unused capacity
```

---

Better:

```yaml
resources:

 requests:

   cpu: 1

   memory: 2Gi
```

---

# 21. Use Cluster Autoscaler

Automatically adjusts nodes.

Example:

```text
More Pods

↓

Need More Nodes

↓

Autoscaler Adds EC2
```

---

# 22. Use Karpenter

Karpenter automatically provisions nodes based on workload requirements.

Example:

```text
Pod Requires:

8 CPU

32GB Memory


Karpenter:

Creates Suitable Instance
```

Benefits:

* Faster scaling
* Better cost efficiency

---

# 23. Use Spot Instances

Spot instances reduce EC2 cost.

